        ":question/problem": "Evaluate the surface integral\n\n$$\n\\iint_S 3\\,\\mathrm{d}S\n$$\n\nwhere $S$ is defined by $z=2 x + 2 y$ for $1\\le x\\le 2$ and $0\\le y\\le 2$.",
